    uco-core:description "viewing child sexual abuse materials for two years, the complaint says" .

<https://caselinker.up.railway.app/resource/case/ncmec_2022_130/admission/2> a cacontology-undercover:IncriminatingStatement ;
    rdfs:label "using his friends and a local restaurant’s WIFI to access the internet" ;
    dcterms:source <https://www.timesleader.com/news/1565306/dennison-township-man-charged-with-sharing-child-sexual-abuse-materials> ;
    ns1:admissionContext "-sex acts only later to feel awful about it as he knew it was wrong, the complaint says. Detectives in the complaint reported O’Connor ad..." ;
